  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; det &#xE5;teruppbyggnadsprojekt LWF genomf&#xF6;rt i Lika-regionen med Sida-st&#xF6;d sedan 1999.Detta projekt, om sammanlagt MSEK 29,95, g&#xE4;ller reparation av totalt 725 hus, samt jordbrukskomponenter f&#xF6;r 575 familjer. Projektet genomf&#xF6;rs under 2000-2001</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project ius a continuation of the Sida-financed LWF-reconstructionproject for returning Serbs in the Lika region, Croatia. It aism at reconstruction of 725 housse, and supplement this with agricultural compcomponents for 525 families. Project cost: MSEK 29,95, implementation time frame: 2000 - 2001</narrative>
  </description>
